@startuml
title Selected MVP - submission, inbox and final approval
start
:Enter date, description, amount, separate payer,\nordered participants, split and optional receipt;
:Send session, payload and idempotency key;
:Resolve actor and perform preliminary validation;
if (Valid input and session?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Return actionable field or session error;
  stop
endif
:Begin transaction; lock group row;
:Recheck membership, participants, payer and reviewer policy;
if (Authorized valid configuration?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Roll back; return policy or authorization error;
  stop
endif
if (Command key already committed?) then (yes)
  if (Payload digest matches?) then (yes)
    :End transaction; return authorized prior result;
  else (no)
    :Roll back; return key conflict;
  endif
  stop
endif
:Calculate BigDecimal shares using largest remainders\nand participant entry order on ties;
:Save PENDING expense, shares, receipt,\nreview snapshot and historical entitlements;
:Insert durable inbox notices for other active members\nwith status PENDING at submission;
:Save command receipt;
if (All submission writes commit?) then (yes)
  :Return saved pending result; no financial postings;
else (no)
  :Roll back everything; return failure or retryable conflict;
  stop
endif
note right
  Inbox reads are independent of review.
  Optional external delivery later uses a committed outbox;
  its worker never gates approval or financial visibility.
end note
:Designated reviewer sends approve/reject,\nexpected version and new command key;
:Resolve actor; begin transaction; lock group then expense;
:Recheck active reviewer authorization and configured policy;
if (Authorized?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Roll back; deny;
  stop
endif
if (Review key already committed?) then (yes)
  :Compare digest; return prior result or conflict;\nend transaction without new postings;
  stop
endif
if (PENDING with expected version?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Roll back; return stale or terminal-state result;
  stop
endif
:Record one-reviewer decision;
if (Approve?) then (yes)
  :Set APPROVED and append positive obligation entries\nfor nonpayer participants with positive shares;
else (reject)
  :Set REJECTED; append no journal entries;
endif
:Save review command receipt;
if (Decision, status and any postings commit together?) then (yes)
  :Return terminal outcome and journal-derived balances;
else (no)
  :Roll back decision, status, entries and command receipt;
endif
stop
@enduml
